[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `main` declares `uint8_t buffer[256]`, and `process_buffer` is allowed to *grow*
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the logical length. In `compact_runs`, a run whose length is `>= threshold` is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m rewritten as a two-byte `value, count` pair, so when `threshold == 1` every
